{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "721f5f80-d14c-4473-b9f2-a860e2bbc6c2",
    "name": "NPHIIS VHF Line Lists API",
    "description": "VHF line lists from hie-auth, read from the analytics Postgres: the same rows and columns as the Superset VHF datasets.\n\n| Endpoint | Rows | Date filter on |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET /reports/vhf/line-list` | Cases and contacts, one per VHF record (Superset \"VHF Line List\") | Date Reported |\n| `GET /reports/vhf/contacts` | Contacts with their 21-day follow-up (Superset \"vhf_contacts\") | contact_date |\n\n**Auth.** Either a Keycloak bearer token (run **Auth > Login**; the token lasts 30 minutes, then **Auth > Refresh Token**), which returns only the rows in the user's area, as in Superset; or `X-Api-Key: {{reportsApiKey}}` for system integrations, which returns every area (see **System access**).\n\n**Query parameters** (all optional)\n\n| Parameter | Values |\n|---|---|\n| `period` | `today`, `yesterday`, `this_week`, `last_week`, `this_month`, `last_month`, `this_year`, `last_year`, `last_<N>_days`, `yyyy`, `yyyy-mm`, `yyyy-mm-dd`, `yyyy-Www`. Kenya dates; weeks run Monday to Sunday. |\n| `from`, `to` | `yyyy-mm-dd`, inclusive. Not together with `period`. |\n| `recordType` | `Case` or `Contact` (line-list only) |\n| `status` | Contacts only: `active` (inside 21 days), `flagged` (reported symptoms), `lost` (3+ days missed), `completed` (21 days done), `converted` (became a case) |\n| `format` | `json` (default) or `csv` |\n| `limit`, `offset` | Paging: `limit` 1-50000 (default 5000), `offset` default 0 |\n\n**JSON response:** `{ status, period, from, to, dateField, total, limit, offset, count, columns, rows }`, where `total` is the full count and `rows` is this page. **CSV:** a file download with the full count in the `X-Total-Count` header.\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| 200 | Rows returned |\n| 400 | Bad parameter; `error` says which |\n| 401 | Missing, invalid or expired token / wrong API key |\n| 403 | User not found |\n| 503 | Line lists not configured on this server (`ANALYTICS_DB_URL` unset) |\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_HOST}}/provider/login",
              "host": [
                "{{API_HOST}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "provider",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Log in as an NPHIIS user. Saves `access_token` to `{{token}}` and `refresh_token` to `{{refresh_token}}`. The token lasts 30 minutes.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"idNumber\": \"{{idNumber}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const t = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", t.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", t.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_HOST}}/provider/refresh_token",
              "host": [
                "{{API_HOST}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "provider",
                "refresh_token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exchange `{{refresh_token}}` for a new token pair.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const t = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", t.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", t.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Line List (cases and contacts)",
      "description": "`GET /reports/vhf/line-list`: one row per VHF record, the same rows and columns as the Superset **VHF Line List** dataset. `period` / `from` / `to` filter on **Date Reported**.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cases this month",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_HOST}}/reports/vhf/line-list?recordType=Case&period=this_month",
              "host": [
                "{{API_HOST}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reports",
                "vhf",
                "line-list"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "recordType",
                  "value": "Case",
                  "description": "Case or Contact (line-list only)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "period",
                  "value": "this_month",
                  "description": "today, yesterday, this_week, last_week, this_month, last_month, this_year, last_year, last_<N>_days, yyyy, yyyy-mm, yyyy-mm-dd or yyyy-Www. Kenya dates; weeks run Monday to Sunday. Not with from/to."
                },
                {
                  "key": "from",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "yyyy-mm-dd, inclusive. Not with period.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "to",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "yyyy-mm-dd, inclusive. Not with period.",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirmed, probable and suspected cases reported this month."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"has rows\", () => pm.expect(b.rows).to.be.an(\"array\"));",
                  "console.log(`${b.count} of ${b.total} rows, ${b.dateField} ${b.from ?? \"…\"} to ${b.to ?? \"…\"}`);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
